<title>USA: Argyle and Hearst to merge 15 TV stations.</title>
<headline>Argyle and Hearst to merge 15 TV stations.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hearst Corp and Argyle Television Inc said Wednesday they have agreed to form Hearst-Argyle Television Inc, a new company that will consist of 12 owned and three managed television stations.</p>
<p>Argyle shareholders will receive $26.50 per share in cash; one share of Series A Common Stock of Hearst-Argyle Television; or a &quot;mixed consideration&quot; of $13.25 in cash and one-half share of series A common stock of Hearst-Argyle.</p>
</text>
